  m_text: 'A real non-metal has a base colour between 32 (man-made black) and 243 (snow), in sRGB values from 0 to 255.


    <b>Predict:</b> Which of these four spheres are outside that range?


    <b>Try:</b> Open each material and read the Base Map colour. Bring the ones outside the range back inside it.


